  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_NAME_FORMAT
    value: <style=title><size=32>{0:Symbol;Upper}</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: "<size=24>Wild substitutes for \nALL symbols.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_SPECIAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=32>

      5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style>

      </size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_ROYAL_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=32>

      5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style>

      </size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=32>

      5 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style>

      </size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: "<size=24>- Free Games is triggered for each line win with 3 or more Bonus
      symbols. \n- Up to 450 Free Games can be triggered with Bonus symbols on all
      win lines. \n\n- Choose between 2 options for Free Games. \n   - Option 1: Play
      the number of Free Games won. All wins will be doubled. \n   - Option 2: Skip
      Free Games and spin a Wheel to win a mystery credit award. \n\n- Mystery credit
      award will be a random amount between the minimum and \n  maximum possible amount
      won in Free Games. \n- User can opt for the mystery credit award bonus anytime
      during Free Games. \n- The min and max amount will be adjusted according to
      Free Games left.\n</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>25 LINES</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Bet Per Line: 1</color></size>'
  - key: BUTTON_FREE_SPIN_START
    value: START
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_LINES
    value: <style=title><size=42>LINES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.

      - Jackpots are available for qualifying bets only.'
  - key: CONTENTS_GAME_TITLE
    value: Immortal Treasures
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_1_1
    value: '<size=20>All wins pay LEFT to RIGHT on adjacent reels, beginning with
      leftmost reel.


      All wins are paid on lines played, which are added to line wins.


      Highest win paid on any played line.


      All wins are multiplied by the number of coins bet per line.


      The feature is triggered when the player has 5 consecutive wins.</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: <size=35>MOMENTUM RE-SPIN RULES</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: '<size=20>During the base game, whenever a spin contains a win on any line,

      the player is paid for wins and all reels will re-spin until there is a losing

      spin or until there are 5 consecutive wins.


      During each re-spin, an extra Goddess symbol will substitute for a

      WILD symbol giving more wins! After the 5th consecutive win, the

      feature will be triggered.</size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WILD_PAYOUT_FORMAT
    value: '<b><size=35>

      5 <style=coinColor>{3:CommaNumber}</style>

      4 <style=coinColor>{2:CommaNumber}</style>

      3 <style=coinColor>{1:CommaNumber}</style>

      2 <style=coinColor>{0:CommaNumber}</style>

      </size></b>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_1
    value: <size=35>SUBSTITUTION PAYS</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_3_2
    value: '<size=23>

      WILDS substitute for all symbols.


      When one or more WILDS substitute in a win, highest win is paid.

      </size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5_1
    value: <size=35>Bonus Free Spins</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_5_2
    value: "<size=20>When triggered the player will receive 14 free spins. \n\nWithin
      the free spins, increasing multipliers will be applied to each\nre-spin. Goddess
      symbols turn to WILDs after each win as in the base\ngame.\n\nIf the player
      continues to win after the 5th consecutive win, then re-spins will continue
      with all Goddess symbols WILD until there is a losing spin.</size>"
  - key: BIG_WIN
    value: Big Win!
  - key: SUPER_BIG_WIN
    value: Super Big Win!
  - key: MEGA_WIN
    value: Mega Win!
  - key: SUPER_MEGA_WIN
    value: Super Mega Win!
  - key: EPIC_WIN
    value: Epic Win!
